            </p>
            <textarea id="customDataTextarea" rows="7" placeholder="2025-01-02,1065,1075,1055,1065,42150
2025-01-03,1070,1085,1065,1075,38920
2025-01-06,1090,1125,1085,1125,68400"
                class="w-full bg-[#0f131a] border border-[#2a2e39] rounded-lg p-3 text-xs font-mono-num text-slate-200 focus:border-blue-500 focus:outline-none mb-3"></textarea>
